@startuml
title View Site Schedule

start

:Coordinator: Enter full name, phone number and zip code of client; or confirmation number for appointment;
:System: Query database schedules;

if (Schedule exists for client) then (yes)
  :System: return schedule information in modifiable form;
  :Coordinator: Modify any fields that require editing;
  :Coordinator: Click submit to send details to database;
  :System: Update data for appointment, for client;
else (no)
  :System: Return 'no schedule';
endif

:System: Show confirmation/no appointment;

stop

@enduml